    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313">

                <pb facs="0366" n="316" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg316"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pringle to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala and Honduras</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-31"><hi rendition="#italic">March 31, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received April 19, 1894.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 77.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith
                    decree No. 491 with translation. This is a very important decree, and I am sorry
                    to say the translation is very poor. I had it done while I was away, and I have
                    not had time to make another one.</p>
                <p>This decree establishes the relations of foreigners residing in this Republic
                    with this Government.</p>
                <p>I would ask the Department carefully to consider this decree, as several of my
                    colleagues have informed me that they were of the opinion that their Governments
                    would not accept some of the clauses without protest.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">D. Lynch Pringle.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d313-a1.xml" xpointer="d313-a1"/>
            </div>
